      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786526124454,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Direct Response (No Tools Needed): If the prompt is a simple greeting (e.g., \"Hello\" or \"How are\nyou?\"), Gemini reasons that no accounting tools are necessary. It generates a friendly text response\ndirectly and terminates the loop in 1 turn.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Direct Response (No Tools Needed): If the prompt is a simple greeting (e.g., \"Hello\" or \"How are you?\"), Gemini reasons that no accounting tools are necessary. It generates a friendly text response directly and terminates the loop in 1 turn.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "o3WslisRDHY1JWITFv_Uq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 546.7547471788193,
      "y": 1309.9444444444443,
